sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Runs as RunsController
  participant Hash as ArchitectureRunIdempotencyHashing
  participant Repo as IArchitectureRunIdempotencyRepository
  participant DB as dbo.ArchitectureRunIdempotency
  Client->>Runs: Idempotency-Key create or commit
  Runs->>Hash: fingerprint request
  Hash->>Repo: lookup or insert
  Repo->>DB: durable key
  DB-->>Runs: same run on replay
  Runs-->>Client: X-Idempotency-Replayed when replayed
